WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.950
Two sets of rules sit
around that computation.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:06.717
The source checks quarantine
a record with no contract end,

3
00:00:06.717 --> 00:00:11.252
or whose sponsor isn't in the HR export,
warn when a sponsor has separated,

4
00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:14.250
and note an engagement
ending within two weeks.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.140
The reconciliation compares the register,
the card system and the directory:

6
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.272
an enabled account past
its end, an orphan account,

7
00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:25.023
a card for someone the
register doesn't hold,

8
00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:29.225
a record with no account, and a leave
date that isn't the earliest end.

9
00:00:29.225 --> 00:00:31.850
It's read only, joined on the person key.
